WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.494
One switch in the header: light, dark, high contrast or the system theme.

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:03.517
Dark keeps the warm amber accent.

00:00:03.517 --> 00:00:06.769
High contrast: white on black, with a yellow accent.

00:00:06.769 --> 00:00:09.240
The choice follows you to skribly.pl and docs.skribly.pl.
